114	// History depth knob. 0 = B-fork (append-only via --fork-session, chat+claude
115	// default — history lives in the forked CLI session, nothing folded into the
116	// prompt). 1-12 = window mode (fold N ancestor turns — the fallback, also used
117	// by codex chat). Anything out of [0,12] or missing → 0.
